    "body": "Hi! It seems this tracker works for the HTTP protocol, but not for the UDP protocol, it just times out. Whatever tool you're using might automatically fallback to HTTP if UDP fails.\r\n\r\nSee for example, in qBittorrent:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/CorralPeltzer/newTrackon/assets/6959494/ab0a21d5-50cb-46b1-8e8e-68a960858e2f)\r\n\r\n\r\nI have changed it to HTTP for now, it shows up as working, but be aware that UDP is actually not working.",
